<% content_for :preheader, "Your dormant account is gone. You’re always welcome back." %>
<img src="cid:loop-monster-goodbye" width="320" alt="Loop Monster smiles and waves goodbye, holding a broken ruby on cobweb-covered rails." style="display: block; width: 100%; max-width: 320px; height: auto; margin: 0 auto 28px;">
<%= render "layouts/heading", eyebrow: "Dormant profile cleanup", title: "Profile annihilated. Door still open." %>
<p>Hey <%= @recipient_name %>,</p>
<p>We’ve deleted your dormant Rails.Builders account and profile.</p>
<p>The rails had collected a few cobwebs. Loop Monster tried dusting. The ruby didn’t make it.</p>
<p>You’re always welcome back. Sign up again and finish setting up your profile whenever you’re ready.</p>
<%= render "layouts/button", label: "Sign up again", url: @url %>
<p>See you when you’re ready,<br>Rich &amp; Loop Monster</p>
